1. `_check_review_record`: task file must have `## 终审记录` section, non-trivial (>=50 chars).
2. `_check_negative_claims`: opinion text must not contain negative claims (不存在/缺失) without `**存在性核查**` anchor.
3. `_check_issue_disposition`: if opinion contains 🟠/🟡 problem entries, must note disposition (建议书/停车场/任务单).

